petent Authority under sub-section (2) of section 20D of the said Act shall be final; The land plans and other details of the land covered under this notification are available and can be inspected by the interested person at the aforesaid office of the Competent Authority. Schedule Brief description of the land to be acquired, with or without structure, for the Special Railway Project, namely, Rajpura-Mohali New Rail Line (18.11 KM) of Northern Railway, in Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar District in the State of Punjab. S.N District Tehsil/ Sub- Tehsil Village Khasra No. Type of Land Nature of Land Area under Acquisition Biswa Hectare 1 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 636 Chahi Private 12 0.0506 2 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 632 Chahi Private 19 0.0801 3 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 633 Chahi Private 88 0.3709 4 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 635 Chahi Private 57 0.2403 5 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 647 Gair Mumkin, Chahi Private 6 0.0253 6 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 630 Gair Mumkin, Chahi Private 48 0.2023 7 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 629 Chahi Private 80 0.3372 8 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 634 Chahi Private 51 0.2150 9 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 648 Chahi Private 29 0.1222 10 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 625 Chahi Private 17 0.0717 11 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 1513/661/1 Chahi Private 18 0.0759 12 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 1514/661/2 Chahi Private 62 0.2613 13 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 659/1-2 Gair Mumkin Private 5 0.0211 14 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 1511/660/1 Chahi Private 57 0.2403 15 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 1511/660/2 Chahi Private 18 0.0759 16 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 658 Chahi Private 40 0.1686 17 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 651 Gair Mumkin Govt. 9 0.0379 18 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 624 Gair Mumkin Govt. 20 0.0843 19 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 649 Chahi Private 74 0.3119 20 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 628 Chahi Private 63 0.2655 21 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 626 Chahi Private 15 0.0632 22 SAS Nagar Banur Tasuli(273) 627 Chahi Private 1 0.0042 23 S